 #D7AFFF][/dim]Fix the 13 ranked defects from the apollo/athena notification and [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]log audit[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Disk pressure names the owners it could not measure, and recovery [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]runs even when attribution is incomplete. Held workspaces stop [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]rewriting the notification store. agent_publication and the error [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]digest report each cause once, with true counts. Measured TUI [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stalls shrink. The six targeted defects (prompt_prose wire, update [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]races, Telegram transport, Codex bundle cap, triage request-id [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]retry, gateway WAL checkpoint) are fixed. Notifications, logs, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]state files follow their stated dedup and retention rules on both [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]hosts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]notification_log_audit_fixes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/notification_log_audit_fixes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1tz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1tz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Honest disk attribution and the held-workspace re-settlement [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]loop (items 1-2)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]outage[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]outage: stop reporting unmeasured disk as 0 B/complete, measure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workspace roots first, run reaping independently of inventory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completeness, and make pressure notices name unmeasured owners and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]escalate missed recovery targets. Settle held workspaces once per [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evidence fingerprint, +1 only when evidence changes, and add a sase-core[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]store guard that coalesces +1s and never rewrites the store for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dismissed rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Publication de-flap, truthful error digests, and TUI stall [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]reduction (items 3-5)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]noise[dim] · [dim][/dim]after outage[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]noise: give agent_publication per-(project, signature) backoff with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]standing alerts, a bounded incremental drain, and a terminal state for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unrestorable prompt archives. Aggregate the error ring and digests by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]signature with durable true counts and pruning. Cut measured TUI GC [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pauses and main-thread I/O stalls, with tui_stalls.jsonl as the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance metric.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Targeted high-confidence defect fixes (items 6-10)[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n    [#AF87FF]defects[dim] · [dim][/dim]after noise[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]defects: add the prompt_prose artifact-link wire variant with a binding [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract test, close the remaining runtime-update races, fix Telegram [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback, retry, and scope semantics, keep provider instruction bundles [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under their caps with a size gate, and advance bead_task_triage's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generation on request_id_conflict.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gateway checkpoint fix, notification hygiene, and retention [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sweep (items 11-13)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]hygiene[dim] · [dim][/dim]after defects[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hygiene: handle SQLite's busy -1 checkpoint result and serve snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-while-revalidate. Fix the remaining notification dedup, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]amplification, orphan, blob-size, and no-op-write issues. Add age-based [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reapers that apply the stated log and state retention horizons.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","created_epic_ids":["sase-1tz.1.1"],"epic_bead_id":"sase-1tz","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1tz.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1tz.1"},"source_run_id":"run-861b86f1e6538d61ff663e42f05936a4","started_at":"2026-11-19T12:11:24.374381+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1795095183,"sha":"06ae058b5fff147bfb39ec81f58a6788141071a5","subject":"feat(axe): report managed tmp skips as standing state"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"a8f816b30ee481d0dd215d145b07dce82f0731b22869b1dd545128eb61a07b26","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1tz.1.1.7/chat.md","size_bytes":8029},"commits":{"digest":"216f014383e0acde9f1c848ff3ad44e7218ae883c929c383c2d7b2d1cc6b2269","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1tz.1.1.7/commits.json","size_bytes":231},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1tz.1.1.7/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"feecd216353d61335550b673c2be41fe31e19283807938d24a6ab777b8604d40",